{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Information.DispersionSuppressionScale","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Information.DispersionSuppressionScale","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.DispersionSuppressionScale.dispersion_suppression_scale","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.DispersionSuppressionScale.dispersion_suppression_scale","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/DispersionSuppressionScale.lean#L41-L51","doc":"**Archimedean suppression of the substrate `q`-dispersion.**\n\n`dispersion_suppression_scale v E_QG` holds when the residual fractional\nvariation `v` of the archimedean photon group velocity is bounded by\n`𝔈 / 𝔈_QG` at every positive photon energy `𝔈`.\n\nA predicate on the variation function, not an existential over it: the\nexistential form is satisfied by any negative constant and so says nothing\n(see the module docstring). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:dispersion-suppression-scale","label":"conj:dispersion-suppression-scale","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/dispersion-suppression-scale.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}